preview in a deterministic object-storage plan. The existing candidate archive, receipt, null IDs and signed APT/RPM bytes are preserved. Shared public entries remain owned by preview; stable RPM uses a mirrorlist pointing to one complete immutable snapshot.\n\nThe explicit stable path validates historical Git control/producer bytes, fresh source assets, attestations and native metadata, and actual candidate signatures before asset writes. Final source/main/tag/policy checks fence publication. TEST ONLY requires loopback endpoints and rejects redirects. Stable remains disabled; production workflows, manifests, keys, permissions and live hosting are unchanged.\n\nValidation on the final reviewed tree:\n\n- 468 Python tests passed (one existing native RPM environment skip), plus four contract tests and the complete contract script.\n- The pinned Linux signing image passed 31 candidate cases plus eight transport cases, including signature checks after removal of test private material, loopback audit readback, deterministic composite output and retained-generation rejection.\n- Independent review found and closed a resolution-file read race with a failing regression before the fix. All 38 protected control/producer files remain byte-identical.\n- The first native attempt exited 137 with an unknown initiator; that failure is retained. The one unchanged isolated repeat and subsequent revision-bound runs passed.\n\nThis PR supplies sealing/transport capability and local validation. Actual production sealing, OSS/CDN activation and exact-version public-client acceptance remain outstanding. Automatic Linux PR checks are pending.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T10:52:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:52:56Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"873b760b734ace5d19d7f56d90ee053c83a3abac","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"WuKongIM:codex/stable-audit-seal-transport","ref":"codex/stable-audit-seal-transport","repo":{"id":1352603694,"node_id":"R_kgDOUJ8YLg","name":"packages","full_name":"WuKongIM/packages","owner":{"login":"WuKongIM","id":132860831,"node_id":"O_kgDOB-tLnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132860831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Signed APT and RPM repositories for WuKongIM","homepage":null,"language":"Python","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":1,"open_issues":1,"size":684,"default_branch":"main","has_issues":false,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_discussions":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pushed_at":"2026-10-21T10:52:23Z","created_at":"2026-08-31T16:03:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:13:15Z","allow_forking":true,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"url":"https://api.github.com/